{"case_id":"C023","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["state","API protocol","entry point","input semantics"],"confidence":98,"affected_functions":["wuffs_base__io_buffer__compact","wuffs_base__io_buffer__io_position_reader","wuffs_base__io_buffer__io_position_writer","wuffs_base__io_buffer__is_valid","wuffs_base__io_reader__is_eof","wuffs_base__io_reader__is_valid","wuffs_base__io_writer__is_valid","wuffs_base__io_writer__set","wuffs_zlib__decoder__decode","wuffs_deflate__decoder__decode","wuffs_gzip__decoder__decode","wuffs_gif__decoder__decode_up_to_id_part1","wuffs_lzw__decoder__decode"],"reason":"H0 exercises only wuffs_zlib__decoder__decode with a canonical, fully populated, closed source buffer and a fixed output buffer. It does not fuzz the migrated wuffs_base__io_buffer data/meta state space, streaming input and coroutine resumption, compaction and non-zero stream positions, or directly changed gzip, GIF, and LZW entry points. Those omissions are material because S1 repeatedly derives pointers and restores indices through data.ptr, data.len, meta.wi, meta.ri, meta.pos, and meta.closed across decoder suspension boundaries.","evidence":["llvmFuzzerTestOneInput constructs the source with ri = 0, wi = size, closed = true, and no explicit non-zero pos, so open or incrementally filled input and non-zero metadata states are never generated.","zlib_fuzzer.c calls only wuffs_zlib__decoder__decode; the changed wuffs_gzip__decoder__decode, GIF decoder functions, and direct wuffs_lzw__decoder__decode surface are not reached as their own protocols.","The destination always has len = 65536, starts from zeroed metadata, and only dst.wi is reset after short_write; H0 never varies data.len, initial meta.wi/meta.ri, meta.closed, or meta.pos.","S1 changes pointer/index synchronization at numerous WUFFS_BASE__COROUTINE_SUSPENSION_POINT boundaries, including wuffs_deflate__decoder__decode_blocks and wuffs_gif__decoder__decode_id_part1, but H0 supplies all source bytes at once and therefore does not drive short-read refill/resume behavior.","S1 changes wuffs_base__io_buffer__compact and both io-position helpers to use meta.ri, meta.wi, and meta.pos, while H0 never calls compact or checks positions.","wuffs_base__io_writer__set contains the explicit comment \"TODO: set b->meta.pos\", but H0 neither invokes this API with varied prior metadata nor checks the resulting position semantics."],"recommended_action":"Add a stateful I/O-buffer fuzz harness that encodes valid data.ptr/data.len and meta.wi/meta.ri/meta.pos/meta.closed configurations, feeds input in variable chunks with open-to-closed transitions, forces short-read and short-write resumptions, invokes compact and position/validity helpers, and checks index and progress invariants. Exercise wuffs_zlib__decoder__decode and wuffs_deflate__decoder__decode directly, with separate protocol-aware coverage for the changed gzip, GIF, and LZW decoder entry points."}
